        " \"لاَ يَرْجِعُ عَلَيْهِ أَبَداً إِلاَّ أَنْ يَكُونَ قَدْ أَفْلَسَ قَبْلَ ذَلِكَ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3259 - Abu Ayyub al-Khazzaz asked Abu Abdillah (as) about a man who transfers his debt to another man.\nImam (as) said: \"He cannot revert the debt back to the original debtor under any circumstances, except if the transferee had already declared bankruptcy before the transfer.\""
        ]
      }
